sentence.sent_text:
Ningoding idash ningii-izhiwinigoog ayaamagak jiisakaan;
                            ningii-piindige; niibiwa i'imaa ningii-waabamaag ogiizhigoowininiwag,
                            anishinaabeng izhinaagoziwag.

Mii dash gii-ani-bazigwiid a'aw oshkinawe; gii-ani-zaaga'am;
                            gaawiin anishinaabeng gii-izhinaagozisii, bineshiinying idash
                            odizhinawaan.
